app_store_listing.md
implement_supporter.md
design/
App Store Assets/

# Local Claude Code configuration
.claude/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# iCloud / Finder conflict copies (e.g. "Foo 2.swift") — never commit; they cause duplicate
